                    "sense_definition": "To cause something to disappear or be forgotten.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "remove",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The joy of the party helped to <w>efface</w> the memory of his difficult week."
